%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e0ce3e543780b04dba488492949ce28, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day6_Offer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  lineArray:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Well, well. Thirty days, and you did it in twenty-eight.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 6
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: I've never been wrong about a farmer.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...You came all this way to tell me that?
    playerEmote: 13
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: That, and this. Sawit Lv.3.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Four times the yield per palm. Your half of the forest, at Lv.3, earns in a week what it earned you in a month.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: I'm not asking you to decide today.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'But remember the first night: one empty bottle and a debt bigger than this village. Look how far you came.'
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: And don't mind the red in the leaves. That's just the land learning to keep up with you.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: "...I never told you about\u2014"
    playerEmote: 4
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Think it over. I'll be by the Fabricator.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  reward:
    itemDataSO: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 0
  rewardDay: 0
